    tags: ["refugio", "adopci\xF3n", "Texas", "no kill"],
    lead: 'Operation Kindness en Dallas, Texas, es uno de los refugios de animales m\xE1s antiguos y exitosos de USA. Fundado en 1971, fue pionero del movimiento "no-kill" d\xE9cadas antes de que se pusiera de moda. Su modelo ha influenciado refugios en todo el mundo.',
    leadEn: 'Operation Kindness in Dallas, Texas, is one of the oldest and most successful animal shelters in the U.S. Founded in 1971, it pioneered the "no-kill" movement decades before it became fashionable. Its model has influenced shelters all over the world.',
    body: [
      { h: "El modelo no-kill: qu\xE9 significa realmente", hEn: "The no-kill model: what it really means", p: '"No-kill" no significa que nunca eutanasian: significa que la eutanasia es solo por enfermedad terminal o comportamiento que representa peligro real. La meta es una tasa de salida viva superior al 90%. Operation Kindness consistentemente supera el 95%.', pEn: '"No-kill" does not mean they never euthanize: it means euthanasia is only for terminal illness or behavior that poses a real danger. The goal is a live-release rate above 90%. Operation Kindness consistently exceeds 95%.' },
      { h: "C\xF3mo logran las cifras", hEn: "How they achieve the numbers", p: 'Programa de foster activo (animales en hogares temporales en lugar de jaulas), marketing agresivo de adopciones, eventos de "feria de adopci\xF3n" frecuentes, asociaciones con empresas locales, y un programa de medicina veterinaria de bajo costo que reduce devoluciones por costos m\xE9dicos.', pEn: 'An active foster program (animals in temporary homes instead of cages), aggressive adoption marketing, frequent "adoption fair" events, partnerships with local businesses and a low-cost veterinary medicine program that reduces returns due to medical costs.' },
      { h: "El rol de la comunidad", hEn: "The role of the community", p: "Operation Kindness tiene m\xE1s de 400 voluntarios activos y una red de 200+ familias de foster. Sus eventos de adopci\xF3n no son solo en el refugio: llevan animales a breweries, parques y eventos comunitarios. La adopci\xF3n va a donde est\xE1 la gente.", pEn: "Operation Kindness has more than 400 active volunteers and a network of 200+ foster families. Its adoption events are not held only at the shelter: they take animals to breweries, parks and community events. Adoption goes to where the people are." },
      { h: "El impacto medido", hEn: "The measured impact", p: "En 2023, Operation Kindness facilit\xF3 4,847 adopciones, 1,563 programas de foster y recoloc\xF3 412 animales con otras organizaciones. Su presupuesto anual de $8 millones es financiado 100% por donaciones privadas sin apoyo gubernamental.", pEn: "In 2023, Operation Kindness facilitated 4,847 adoptions, 1,563 foster placements and transferred 412 animals to other organizations. Its annual budget of $8 million is funded 100% by private donations with no government support." }
    ],
    stat: "Desde su fundaci\xF3n en 1971, Operation Kindness ha salvado y encontrado hogares para m\xE1s de 175,000 animales en el norte de Texas, convirti\xE9ndose en modelo de referencia para refugios en USA y Latinoam\xE9rica.",
    statEn: "Since its founding in 1971, Operation Kindness has saved and found homes for more than 175,000 animals in North Texas, becoming a reference model for shelters in the U.S. and Latin America.",
    tips: [],
    tipsEn: [],
    close: 'El modelo de Operation Kindness demuestra que "no-kill" no es ideolog\xEDa: es operaci\xF3n eficiente, comunidad comprometida y marketing inteligente. Es replicable. Y en muchas ciudades de USA y el mundo, est\xE1 siendo replicado.',
    closeEn: 'The Operation Kindness model proves that "no-kill" is not ideology: it is efficient operations, a committed community and smart marketing. It is replicable. And in many cities across the U.S. and the world, it is being replicated.'
